===Etymology===
From {{der|mul|grc|δέκα||ten}} + {{m|grc|ὀκτώ||eight}}, from a traditional interpretation of its call as these words; in a Greek fable the bird was sent by the gods in answer to a servant girl's prayer that the world would be told of her paltry salary of 18 coins.

